<title>USA: Smithfield Foods stake cut by group.</title>
<headline>Smithfield Foods stake cut by group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Clark Estates Inc said Thursday it reduced its stake in Smithfield Foods Inc to 4.9 percent or 895,385 shares.</p>
<p>It said it sold 450,000 shares of the Norfolk meat processor between March 25 and April 4 at $41.06 to $45.24 a share.</p>
